translate zh_hans strings:
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:12
    old "Leave the room."
    new "离开房间。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:13
    old "Something smells good, time to head downstairs."
    new "闻起来很香，该下楼去了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:15
    old "Enter to the kitchen."
    new "进入厨房。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:16
    old "I should check in with [saga.cast.debbie] before I leave."
    new "离开前我应该跟[saga.cast.debbie]确认一下。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:18
    old "Leave the house."
    new "离开房子。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:19
    old "Best be on my way, don't want to be late on my first day back."
    new "最好马上出发，可不想第一天复职就迟到。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:21
    old "Visit [saga.cast.erik]'s house."
    new "拜访[saga.cast.erik]的家。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:22
    old "[saga.cast.erik] had better not have overslept again! Best pop next door and find out."
    new "[saga.cast.erik]最好没有再睡过头！最好去隔壁看看。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:24
    old "Speak to [saga.cast.erik]."
    new "和[saga.cast.erik]交谈。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:25
    old "Of course [saga.cast.erik] is gaming..."
    new "当然[saga.cast.erik]在玩游戏……"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:27
    old "Visit the school."
    new "参观学校。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:28
    old "We should hurry to school, don't want to be late on my first day back."
    new "我们得赶紧去学校，我可不想第一天回来就迟到。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:30
    old "Enter the school."
    new "进入学校。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:31
    old "First day back, here we go again."
    new "第一天回来，我们又开始了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:33
    old "Inspect the stairwell."
    new "仔细检查楼梯间。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:34
    old "The principal's office is on the top floor, I should get there ASAP!"
    new "校长办公室在顶层，我得尽快过去！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:36
    old "Enter the principal's office on the third floor."
    new "进入三楼的校长办公室。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:39
    old "Inspect your locker on the first floor."
    new "检查你在一楼的储物柜。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:40
    old "I can't believe I forgot my combination. Guess I'll head down to my locker and wait."
    new "我居然忘了我的密码。看来我得下楼去我的储物柜那儿等着了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:45
    old "Enter the left hallway."
    new "进入左边的走廊。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:46
    old "I should get changed for gym class."
    new "我该为体育课换衣服了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:48
    old "Enter the boys' locker room."
    new "进入男生更衣室。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:49
    old "So the girls are sharing the boys locker room now? I wish I'd have gotten here sooner!"
    new "所以女生们现在共用男生更衣室吗？我真希望自己早点到这里！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:51
    old "Visit the track."
    new "参观跑道。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:52
    old "Ugh, it's too hot for gym class."
    new "呃，天气太热了，不适合上体育课。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:55
    old "Great, now I'm all stinky."
    new "太好了，现在我一身臭汗。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:57
    old "Enter the French class."
    new "进入法语课堂。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:58
    old "L'heure du français!"
    new "L'heure du français!（法语课时间到！）"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:60
    old "Enter the hallway."
    new "进入走廊。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:61
    old "Class is finally over... Thank goodness!"
    new "终于下课了……谢天谢地！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:64
    old "It was nice to see all my friends again."
    new "再次见到所有朋友真是太好了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:66
    old "Enter the lobby."
    new "进入大厅。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:67
    old "Someone's at the door downstairs. I wonder who?"
    new "楼下有人敲门。会是谁呢？"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:70
    old "The cops are still investigating... I guess, we just wait."
    new "警察还在调查……我想，我们还是等着吧。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:72
    old "Enter the kitchen."
    new "进入厨房。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:73
    old "Something smells good! I should get to the kitchen; wouldn't want to miss out!"
    new "闻起来好香！我得去厨房，可不想错过！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:75
    old "Enter the front yard."
    new "进入前院。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:76
    old "The front door again? Who could it be this time?"
    new "又是前门？这次会是谁呢？"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:79
    old "Whoa, I just need to do something else for a while and process."
    new "哇，我只是需要暂时做点别的事，整理一下思绪。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:84
    old "Leave the house when [saga.cast.debbie] is going to the mall."
    new "趁[saga.cast.debbie]去商场的时候离开家。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:85
    old "I hope those thugs never give [saga.cast.debbie] trouble when she goes to the mall."
    new "我希望那些暴徒在她去商场时永远不要给[saga.cast.debbie]找麻烦。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:88
    old "Ahh, normality... I hope it lasts!"
    new "啊，正常的生活……我希望它能持续下去！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:91
    old "No more signs of trouble but I should remain vigilant."
    new "没有更多麻烦的迹象了，但我应该保持警惕。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:96
    old "Leave the house during the day."
    new "白天离开房子。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:100
    old "Gah, I knew this wasn't over!"
    new "啊，我就知道这事还没完！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:103
    old "Am I paranoid if they really {i}are{/i} out to get me?!"
    new "如果他们真的{i}在{/i}追捕我，那我是偏执狂吗？！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:105
    old "Leave your house and then return."
    new "离开你的房子，然后返回。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:106
    old "Why do I have this ominous feeling in the pit of my stomach?"
    new "为什么我心底有种不祥的预感？"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:108
    old "Leave your house and then return during the day."
    new "白天离开家，然后再回来。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:112
    old "Today was crazy!"
    new "今天真是疯狂的一天！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:115
    old "Who even is this [saga.cast.tony] guy, and why were the Russian goons so afraid of him?"
    new "这个[saga.cast.tony]到底是谁？为什么那些俄罗斯打手那么怕他？"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:117
    old "Visit the pizzeria."
    new "去披萨店。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:118
    old "I should get over to the pizzeria and see what [saga.cast.tony] wants."
    new "我得去披萨店看看[saga.cast.tony]想干什么。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:120
    old "Leave the area."
    new "离开这个区域。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:121
    old "Why on earth did I lie? I have a bicycle already, and now [saga.cast.tony] has kindly given me money to buy one! I can't let him find out. What a mess. I'm such an idiot."
    new "我为什么要撒谎？我已经有一辆自行车了，现在[saga.cast.tony]还好心给了我买车的钱！绝不能让他发现。真是糟透了。我真是个白痴。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:126
    old "Purchase a bicycle from Consum-R at the mall."
    new "在商场的购乐百货购买一辆自行车。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:127
    old "I can't believe [saga.cast.tony] just gave me money for a bicycle!"
    new "真不敢相信[saga.cast.tony]竟然给我钱买自行车！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:129
    old "Speak with [saga.cast.tony] about the bike."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]谈谈自行车的事。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:130
    old "Time to let [saga.cast.tony] know I have a bike and I'm not afraid to use it!"
    new "是时候让[saga.cast.tony]知道我有自行车了，而且我敢骑！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:133
    old "Well, that was incredibly unlucky, who collects their own pizza these days? Guess I'll come back later."
    new "唉，真是太倒霉了，这年头谁还自己取披萨啊？我还是晚点再来吧。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:135
    old "Speak with [saga.cast.tony] about the trial run."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]谈谈试运行的事。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:136
    old "Right, enough false starts! Time to show [saga.cast.tony] what I can do!"
    new "好了，别再出岔子了！该让[saga.cast.tony]看看我的本事了！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:138
    old "Inspect the pizza boxes on the counter."
    new "检查柜台上的披萨盒。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:139
    old "Time for a trial run. I've seen the movies, I know the tropes, but really, how hard can it be to deliver a few pizzas? I got this."
    new "试运行的时候到了。我看过电影，我知道那些套路，但说真的，送几个披萨能有多难？我能搞定。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:141
    old "Speak to [saga.cast.maria]."
    new "与[saga.cast.maria]交谈。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:142
    old "[saga.cast.maria] sounded formidable, I hope she's willing to let me work here."
    new "[saga.cast.maria]听起来很厉害，我希望她愿意让我在这里工作。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:145
    old "That [saga.cast.tony] guy is kinda awesome! I can't believe he gave me a job just like that!"
    new "那个[saga.cast.tony]家伙有点厉害！真不敢相信他就这样给了我一份工作！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:148
    old "Time to clock in for my shift at the pizzeria again."
    new "又到了该在披萨店打卡上班的时间了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:150
    old "Deliver [max(0, f.need - saga.prop.pizza_boxes.ever)] more pizzas."
    new "再送[max(0, f.need - saga.prop.pizza_boxes.ever)]个披萨。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:151
    old "Bonding with [saga.cast.tony] sure was fun... probably."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]建立感情确实很有趣……大概吧。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:157
    old "Not to toot my own horn, but I'm kinda crushing this whole pizza delivery gig."
    new "不是我自夸，但我送披萨这份工作干得还挺不错的。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:159
    old "Purchase a vehicle from the dealership."
    new "从经销商那里购买一辆车。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:160
    old "Fingers crossed the car dealership has something in my price bracket!"
    new "希望汽车经销商那里有我能买得起的车！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:162
    old "Speak to [saga.cast.tony] about your vehicle."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]谈谈你的车。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:163
    old "I can't wait to tell [saga.cast.tony], the thing just purrs along!"
    new "我等不及要告诉[saga.cast.tony]了，这车开起来又安静又顺畅！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:166
    old "I think I'm really getting the hang of this pizza thing now."
    new "我觉得我现在真的摸清送披萨的门道了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:169
    old "Food delivery is an essential service! I'd better get out there!"
    new "送外卖可是重要服务！我最好赶紧出发！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:171
    old "Visit the pizzeria before evening."
    new "傍晚前光临披萨店。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:175
    old "Never though I'd be helping cook when I signed up as a delivery boy! Hope [saga.cast.maria] is a good teacher. Ready? Steady? Cook!"
    new "从没想过我报名当外卖员的时候还要帮忙做饭！希望[saga.cast.maria]是个好老师。准备？稳当？开煮！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:178
    old "Holy cannoli, that was awkward! I did get the rest of the day off though, guess I ought to make the most of it."
    new "天啊，真尴尬！不过我今天剩下的时间确实放假了，我想我得好好利用一下。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:181
    old "Maybe it's time to pop by the pizzeria and see how [saga.cast.tony] is doing."
    new "也许是时候顺便去披萨店看看[saga.cast.tony]怎么样了。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:184
    old "It's a tough break, but [saga.cast.tony] seems to have taken it on the chin. I'm sure he'll be okay."
    new "这真是倒霉，但[saga.cast.tony]似乎坦然接受了。我肯定他没事的。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:192
    old "Inspect the sack in the pantry."
    new "检查储藏室里的那个袋子。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:193
    old "Flour for a pretty lady? It's in the store room, and [saga.cast.maria]'s waiting."
    new "给漂亮女士的面粉？在储藏室里，[saga.cast.maria]在等着呢。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:196
    old "The sack is too heavy to lift alone, maybe I should ask for help."
    new "这个袋子太重了，我一个人搬不动，也许我该找人帮忙。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:199
    old "I'm seriously glad [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria] were able to handle those goons. I don't know where I'd be if I was alone in this."
    new "我真的很庆幸[saga.cast.tony]和[saga.cast.maria]能对付那些打手。要是我一个人的话，真不知道会怎样。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:205
    old "Bonding with [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria] sure was fun... probably."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]、[saga.cast.maria]增进感情确实挺有趣的……大概吧。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:208
    old "After all this delivering, I could really trade these margheritas for margaritas. >_>"
    new "送了这么久外卖，我真想用这些玛格丽特披萨换杯玛格丽塔酒喝喝。>_>"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:210
    old "Deliver another pizza."
    new "再送一份披萨。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:214
    old "I've delivered a lot of pizzas, surely [saga.cast.tony] won't mind if I take a break this weekend."
    new "我已经送了很多披萨了，[saga.cast.tony]肯定不会介意我这个周末休息一下。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:217
    old "[saga.cast.tony] said I should swing by this evening because he had a job for me. Wonder what it could be."
    new "[saga.cast.tony]说我今晚应该过去一趟，因为他有活儿给我。不知道会是什么事。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:220
    old "Time to find out what job it is that [saga.cast.tony] has for me at the pizzeria, he was being unusually cagey about it."
    new "是时候去看看[saga.cast.tony]在披萨店给我安排了什么活儿了，他对此异常地遮遮掩掩。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:222
    old "Visit the apartment complex."
    new "前往公寓大楼。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:223
    old "[saga.cast.tony] said customer satisfaction was important, so I should get a move on!"
    new "[saga.cast.tony]说顾客满意度很重要，所以我得赶紧行动了！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:225
    old "Visit apartment 301."
    new "前往301号公寓。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:226
    old "The quicker I find 301 the better, this monstrosity is almost beginning to smell good!"
    new "我越快找到301越好，这怪物开始闻起来都香了！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:232
    old "I can't believe [saga.cast.tony] set me up with an \"extra sausage\" order for [saga.cast.tina]—and that she's [saga.cast.becca]'s mom! Does this mean I'm some kind of pizza gigolo now?!"
    new "真不敢相信[saga.cast.tony]给我安排了给[saga.cast.tina]的“额外香肠”订单——而且她还是[saga.cast.becca]的妈妈！难道我现在成了披萨小白脸了？！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:235
    old "I hope the adoption meeting is going well for [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria]."
    new "希望[saga.cast.tony]和[saga.cast.maria]的领养会面进展顺利。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:238
    old "I should go find out how [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria] got on at the adoption agency."
    new "我应该去了解一下[saga.cast.tony]和[saga.cast.maria]在收养机构的情况如何。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:241
    old "Well, that blows! [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria] would be great parents. I hope Eddie can give us a lead."
    new "唉，真糟糕！[saga.cast.tony]和[saga.cast.maria]会是很好的父母。希望埃迪能给我们提供线索。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:244
    old "With [saga.cast.tony] off visiting Eddie in prison, [saga.cast.maria] is running the pizzeria solo... but if anyone can handle it, it's her."
    new "[saga.cast.tony]去监狱探望埃迪了，[saga.cast.maria]独自经营着披萨店……但要说谁能应付得来，非她莫属。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:250
    old "Bonding with [saga.cast.maria] sure was something... probably."
    new "与[saga.cast.maria]培养感情确实是……大概吧。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:253
    old "[saga.cast.tony] should be back from his trip by now. I should head to the pizzeria and see if he got anything useful from Eddie."
    new "[saga.cast.tony]现在应该已经从旅途回来了。我该去披萨店看看，他是否从Eddie那里得到了什么有用的信息。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:256
    old "This is crazy! I can't believe [saga.cast.tony] wants me to have sex with [saga.cast.maria]!"
    new "这太疯狂了！我真不敢相信[saga.cast.tony]想让我和[saga.cast.maria]发生关系！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:259
    old "I can't decide if I'm more nervous or excited. [saga.cast.tony] and [saga.cast.maria] will be waiting for me."
    new "我分不清自己是更紧张还是更兴奋。[saga.cast.tony]和[saga.cast.maria]会在等我。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:262
    old "No sense hanging around, just gotta push past the weirdness."
    new "没必要犹豫，只能克服这种不适感。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:264
    old "Enter the pantry."
    new "进入食品储藏室。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:268
    old "Well, that was a thing. I wonder if it worked, how many more times will we need to try."
    new "嗯，那还真是……我不确定有没有成功，不知道我们还得再试多少次。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:270
    old "Speak with [saga.cast.tony] about a baby."
    new "和[saga.cast.tony]谈谈关于孩子的事。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:271
    old "Keep trying to get [saga.cast.maria] pregnant."
    new "继续尝试让[saga.cast.maria]怀孕。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:274
    old "[saga.cast.tony] needs to see me urgently at the pizzeria. I wonder what's the matter!"
    new "[saga.cast.tony]急需在披萨店见我。不知道出什么事了！"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:280
    old "Inspect the block of clay."
    new "检查这块黏土。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:281
    old "There should be a block of clay in here somewhere."
    new "这里面某个地方应该有一块黏土。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:283
    old "Speak to [saga.cast.barb]."
    new "与[saga.cast.barb]交谈。"
    # game/res/meta/step.rpym:284
    old "I should speak with her about that art contest."
    new "我应该和她谈谈那个艺术比赛的事。"
